bby  is actually a better laptop replacement  than the iPad pro since Vadim recently  did a video on how the iPad pro is a  viable laptop replacement  I think that'll just be best to let him  take over and explain exactly why the  most important thing that can make the  Tab s 6 a better laptop replacement than  the iPad pro is a pretty amazing feature  called Samsung deck  it's basically an operating system  that's instantly accessible from an app  what's so special about it is that it  gives you full courser support and you  get a desktop layout that's very similar  to Windows 10 with the Start menu and  app shortcuts right on the desktop you  get incredible multitasking with  rearranged by windows and apps minimize  into the menu bar as well not only that  but you get traditional drag-and-drop  file storage support just like we're  used to on a Windows or Mac computer to  put the cherry on top the available  keyboard case actually comes with a  trackpad now we won't be able to tell  how well it works until we get the tab  as six into the office but the built-in  trackpad makes it feel so much more like  an actual laptop especially using  Samsung desks and while Apple's iPad  does get Mouse support it just mimics  touch input instead of actually  registering clicks so you can't really  use it like you would on a desktop  computer with the tab s6 though you can  plug it into an external monitor connect  a bluetooth mouse and keyboard internal  index to have a legitimate desktop  computer experience and to make it even  better the tap s6 comes with a stylus in  the box  unlike the Apple pencil which you have  to purchase separately for $130 the best  part is that the 256 gigabyte storage  model only cost seven hundred and twenty  nine dollars and it comes with eight  gigabytes of RAM compared to the iPad  pros four gigs of ram and if you buy the  keyboard case before September 22nd you  can get it for half off that means that  with the tab s6 you can get a complete  